# QUESTR — Caddy reverse proxy
#
# Terminates TLS for ${SITE_ADDRESS} (automatic Let's Encrypt certificate via
# HTTP-01 challenge on port 80) and reverse-proxies all traffic to the nginx
# container, which serves the SPA and proxies /api to the backend.
#
# ${SITE_ADDRESS} is injected from the DOMAIN env var in docker-compose.prod.yml.

{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy nginx:80
}
